## Constraints

- Think like an owner, not a trader. No trading-pattern language.
- Every `evidence_quotes` entry must be a verbatim substring of the transcript. If you cannot find a verbatim quote, set the entry to null.
- If `flash_pipeline_output` is present, reuse its INTEL/FORENSIC/CRITICAL FACTOR work only with its sources and periods. Recheck stale or changed inputs; prior conclusions are synthesis, not original evidence. Its valuation work (price targets, ratings) does not enter the board — deep's valuation evidence flows to THESIS directly.
- The 8 parts are mandatory. Even if a part has thin evidence, write it and note the gap.
